{
  "id": "commissionHome",
  "endPoints": [
    {
      "baseUrlType": "orchestrate",
      "name": "checkDctStatus",
      "authType": "sso",
      "httpMethod": "GET",
      "url": "<%  'checkDataChangeStatus/launch'  %>"
    },
    {
      "name": "getInFlightTransactions",
      "baseUrlType": "workday-wql",
      "authType": "sso",
      "httpMethod": "GET",
      "exclude" : "<% empty checkDctStatus.status %>",
      "url": "<% 
              var WQLstring = `SELECT dataChangeTask, workdayID, correctionsToProcess{amount} FROM {{site.applicationId}}_transactionsToProcesses`; 
             return 'data?query=' + string:urlEncode(WQLstring);
             %>"
    }
  ],
  "include": [
    "dctCardGenerator.script"
  ],
  "presentation": {
    "headerSize": "STANDARD",
    "title": {
      "type": "title",
      "label": "Prism + Extend - Edit Grids with A Lot of Data"
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "section",
      "horizontal": false,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "horizontal": true,
          "columnWidthRatios": [
            0.7,
            0.3
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "Overview",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "richText",
                  "value": "<p>This app highlights the importance for designing scalable pages when interacting with large data sets. It also highlights a single threaded pattern for for triggering Prism Data Change Tasks (DCT) that reduce the risk of queuing up Prism transformations. </p> </br><p>There are generally two schools of thought when trying to work with potentially large data sets and grids: <ul><li>Limit the number of instances displayed.</li><li>Use pagination which is available on View pages.</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "cardContainer",
                  "layout": "MASONRY",
                  "cards": [
                    {
                      "type": "card",
                      "cardId": "NavPill",
                      "id": "editGridPatterns"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "card",
                      "cardId": "infoCard",
                      "parameters": "<% dctCardGenerator.generateInfo(checkStatus()) %>",
                      "id": "DCToptions"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "footer": {
      "type": "footer",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "enabled": "false",
          "value": "Powered By<br/><b>Workday Extend</b>"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "script": "<%
                
                let checkStatus = function(){
                if (checkDctStatus.status == 'locked' ) {
                return 'dctProcessing';
                } else if (empty 
                getInFlightTransactions.data[0]?.correctionsToProcess){
                return 'noDataToProcess';
                } else {
                return 'DCTavailable';
                }
                }
               %>"
}